1
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,550
What a waste of a good specimen.

2
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,180
Forget it.

3
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,000
We've drawn enough blood anyway.

4
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:52,260
Soon, there will be another Shen Tianbai
in Ningcheng.

5
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:53,670
Hui.

6
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:56,010
Hui.

7
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:00,910
Dispose of the body.

8
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,420
Remember,

9
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:03,950
don't let the word out.

10
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,480
Yes.

11
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:21,180
What do you want me to do?

12
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,039
Help me take something out.

13
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:25,140
Tell me

14
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:26,700
what you want me to take.

15
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,780
My corpse.

16
00:01:32,009 --> 00:01:34,550
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 24]

17
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:36,509
This kid is really something.

18
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,300
I'll have to praise him later.

19
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,560
Tianbai,

20
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,560
why are you lying here?

21
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,560
Why are you so cold?

22
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,160
It's all my fault

23
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:13,650
for letting you take on
such a dangerous mission.

24
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,520
Tianbai!

25
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:19,820
Officer Wu.

26
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,130
It's not the time to cry yet.

27
00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:28,340
He left this.

28
00:02:30,050 --> 00:02:31,450
Do you know what it means?

29
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:35,510
G0.

30
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:39,579
This is the serial number for the shipment
of drugs your father trafficked.

31
00:02:39,579 --> 00:02:41,810
The shipment
was the first-generation version.

32
00:02:41,810 --> 00:02:43,730
It should be discontinued by now.

33
00:02:44,990 --> 00:02:46,020
Could it be that

34
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:47,740
the antidote lies in

35
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,780
fighting poison with poison?

36
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:53,770
But when the shipment was stored
in the police station warehouse,

37
00:02:53,770 --> 00:02:55,010
it was destroyed.

38
00:02:55,570 --> 00:02:58,430
Even if it is the antidote,
we can't find it anymore.

39
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:01,580
Tianbai clearly knew this,
so why would he—

40
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,460
I believe him.

41
00:03:23,550 --> 00:03:25,750
If he says it's there, it must be.

42
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,380
If the shipment still exists,

43
00:03:29,590 --> 00:03:31,050
I will definitely find it.

44
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,740
Could it be that

45
00:03:51,530 --> 00:03:53,290
Lu Wenbiao kept a box?

46
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:57,430
[Spirit Tablet of Lu Wenbiao]

47
00:03:54,780 --> 00:03:57,910
My old man prepared
a spirit tablet for himself early on.

48
00:03:58,010 --> 00:03:59,470
He wasn't afraid of death.

49
00:04:00,210 --> 00:04:02,330
He was afraid of dying
an unjustified death.

50
00:04:02,330 --> 00:04:05,450
If he wanted to leave something
behind before he died,

51
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,240
it must be in...

52
00:04:18,970 --> 00:04:20,310
Tianjiu Alley.

53
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,370
The dry well in the east.

54
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,770
Thirteen grids under the blue bricks.

55
00:04:41,820 --> 00:04:43,460
Transporting drugs for them

56
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:46,170
is indeed the greatest mistake of my life.

57
00:04:46,210 --> 00:04:47,770
It is undeniable

58
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,420
and unforgivable.

59
00:04:50,090 --> 00:04:52,010
I don't know how to make amends.

60
00:04:52,409 --> 00:04:54,010
I could only hold back one box

61
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:55,860
as a backup,

62
00:04:56,159 --> 00:04:57,690
hoping that one day,

63
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,250
it could atone for my sins a little.

64
00:05:02,710 --> 00:05:04,350
Director. Director.

65
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,760
Something happened in Tianjiu Alley.

66
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,300
I don't know what happened
to those people from before,

67
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,730
but the poison inside their bodies
has been completely neutralized.

68
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:10,570
What?

69
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:15,110
With the Qingtian Gang protecting them,
our men can't stop them at all.

70
00:05:15,110 --> 00:05:16,770
And those from the Shisha Gang—

71
00:05:16,770 --> 00:05:19,500
If the director isn't removed,
Ningcheng won't know peace!

72
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:21,060
Ningcheng is our home!

73
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,350
[Wolf Toxin: Westerner's Trick Bought with
Blood of Ningcheng People]

74
00:05:21,090 --> 00:05:22,470
We will defend it to the death!

75
00:05:22,470 --> 00:05:23,890
The police director
colluded with foreigners

76
00:05:23,890 --> 00:05:25,400
and used civilians for experiments!

77
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,320
He is guilty of heinous crimes!

78
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,420
If the director isn't removed,
Ningcheng won't know peace!

79
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:30,420
Human experiments are heinous crimes!

80
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:32,980
If the director isn't removed,
Ningcheng won't know peace!

81
00:05:32,980 --> 00:05:34,020
-If the director isn't removed,
-If the director isn't removed,

82
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:35,530
-Ningcheng won't know peace!
-Ningcheng won't know peace!

83
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:36,870
-If the director isn't removed,
-If the director isn't removed,

84
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:38,720
-Ningcheng won't know peace!
-Ningcheng won't know peace!

85
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,240
You,

86
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:40,260
you go out first.

87
00:05:40,490 --> 00:05:40,930
Okay.

88
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,640
Chase him.

89
00:05:54,659 --> 00:05:55,590
He can't get far.

90
00:06:10,030 --> 00:06:11,350
At this point,

91
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,320
where else can you run?

92
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:18,050
I should have settled
this score with you long ago.

93
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,320
Lu Ye,

94
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,120
I underestimated you.

95
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,420
I originally thought
you were like your father,

96
00:06:26,420 --> 00:06:28,520
a sentimental fool
who values love and loyalty.

97
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,660
I didn't expect

98
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,900
that as long as you won,

99
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,670
you could sacrifice anyone,

100
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:35,080
even Shen Tianbai!

101
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:36,960
You don't deserve to mention him!

102
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:39,820
Lu Ye,

103
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,750
I calculated everything,

104
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,400
but I just couldn't read you.

105
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:49,630
There are too many things in this world

106
00:06:49,650 --> 00:06:50,880
that are more important than living

107
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,600
and than living together.

108
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,680
People like you

109
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,770
will never understand.

110
00:06:57,210 --> 00:06:58,380
You are so arrogant

111
00:06:58,650 --> 00:07:01,310
that you thought
you could control everything,

112
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:05,220
but you didn't realize you were
just a lackey for the foreigners.

113
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,280
If you die,

114
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,310
there will be thousands more like you.

115
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:10,730
What's the difference
between you and Xu Qingdao?

116
00:07:10,730 --> 00:07:11,730
Impossible!

117
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,650
How could I be like him?

118
00:07:13,970 --> 00:07:14,530
You...

119
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:42,840
It's over.

120
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,480
It's all over.

121
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:47,760
You are quite clear-headed.

122
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,200
They all asked me

123
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,690
why I was so sure
you could bring the antidote out.

124
00:07:54,090 --> 00:07:57,250
I thought to myself,
since you've decided to die,

125
00:07:55,250 --> 00:07:57,530
♪ A strand of obsession ♪

126
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,160
what else could you not accomplish?

127
00:07:59,310 --> 00:08:01,690
♪ A mortal vessel ♪

128
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,580
You didn't expect it, did you?

129
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,800
I guessed it from the very first sentence.

130
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:09,300
♪ Whose incarnation
dwells within distinct souls? ♪

131
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,320
Shen Tianbai.

132
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,080
Hello.

133
00:08:11,660 --> 00:08:13,540
♪ Foes locked in strife ♪

134
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:17,540
♪ Are Incomplete in their fates ♪

135
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,100
When we graduated,

136
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:22,460
♪ We both refused to accept this verdict ♪

137
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:21,720
you asked me at the station

138
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:25,770
♪ Left with endless questions ♪

139
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,480
why I didn't say goodbye.

140
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,040
I said,

141
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:31,940
♪ Down the long street once more ♪

142
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,520
"We haven't even said hello.

143
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:35,950
♪ Lamplight traces
the curve of your profile ♪

144
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,260
People who haven't said hello

145
00:08:36,630 --> 00:08:42,950
♪ Let wind speak for
silent pleas for vindication ♪

146
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,059
have no right to say goodbye."

147
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:48,080
♪ Down the long street once more ♪

148
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,280
Now you've said it.

149
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,600
Shen Tianbai,

150
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:52,580
♪ Who gently folds the past away? ♪

151
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:55,370
♪ Reality is but an illusion ♪

152
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,920
we really have to say goodbye now.

153
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:57,370
♪ Long has my heart been overthrown ♪

154
00:08:58,070 --> 00:09:00,630
♪ I yearn for you though we stay apart ♪

155
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:03,670
♪ Our turbulent feelings
stir within our eyes ♪

156
00:09:03,690 --> 00:09:05,460
♪ Love and hate collide
within a fleeting moment ♪

157
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:09,150
♪ Stirring at the very edge of memory ♪

158
00:09:13,010 --> 00:09:15,010
♪ If only I could ♪

159
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:19,220
♪ Have a future with you ♪

160
00:09:21,130 --> 00:09:26,890
♪ I cling tight to the past,
wishing time would hold its breath ♪

161
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,480
International public opinion has blown up.

162
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,840
The foreigners feel humiliated,

163
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,920
so they had to stop.

164
00:09:51,290 --> 00:09:52,620
With the director dead,

165
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,320
this mess has been uprooted.

166
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:58,320
A large number of people
at the top have been replaced.

167
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,240
The antidote has been distributed
in batches.

168
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,300
It was a close call,

169
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,900
but Ningcheng is safe.

170
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,360
That's great.

171
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:05,420
What about you?

172
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:08,370
Have the matters
of the Shisha Gang been handled?

173
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,360
Xu Qingdao schemed his whole life.

174
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,480
He probably never calculated

175
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,120
that he would die so easily,

176
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:21,000
ending in total ignominy.

177
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,520
All of this

178
00:10:25,130 --> 00:10:26,370
is his retribution.

179
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,160
All key positions within the Shisha Gang

180
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,490
are now filled by my men.

181
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,980
Even if some still refuse to fall in line,

182
00:10:37,980 --> 00:10:40,380
they ought to see
where things stand by now.

183
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,560
You helped me,

184
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,120
so I should thank you too.

185
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,200
I happen to have a friend

186
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:48,150
who specializes in studying
this kind of poison.

187
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,630
This is his business card.

188
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:02,420
Thank you for making a special trip back.

189
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,520
Not at all.

190
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,880
Miss Xu's friend is my friend as well.

191
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,620
Mr. Lu,

192
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,720
you were right.

193
00:11:08,950 --> 00:11:09,950
He is still alive.

194
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:14,080
But this situation is indeed very rare.

195
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,760
That's great.

196
00:11:17,170 --> 00:11:19,650
I'm curious how you found out.

197
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,050
Because of this key.

198
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:25,500
If he were really dead,

199
00:11:26,170 --> 00:11:26,950
after rigor mortis,

200
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:28,480
the body would become very soft,

201
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,280
but I couldn't take this key out.

202
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,840
So I thought

203
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,680
maybe there was still a glimmer of hope.

204
00:11:35,430 --> 00:11:36,430
It just so happens

205
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,000
that you are his first blood source.

206
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,600
Maybe you can wake him up.

207
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,080
But if we do this,

208
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,490
there will be a problem.

209
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:44,840
Ordinary maintenance doses
will be ineffective for him.

210
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,320
Only your blood will work.

211
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,360
Have you thought it through?

212
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,460
Of course.

213
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:52,570
After the blood transfusion,

214
00:11:52,570 --> 00:11:54,300
I will take him to a lab in the UK.

215
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:56,080
The most precise instruments are there.

216
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:58,340
I'll have to trouble you to wait for news.

217
00:11:58,640 --> 00:11:59,270
Okay.

218
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:04,800
Dad,

219
00:12:04,970 --> 00:12:07,200
[Spirit Tablet of Lu Wenbiao]

220
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,440
don't worry.

221
00:12:06,690 --> 00:12:09,020
I've taken care of everything in the gang.

222
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:12,640
I've turned several branches
into rehabilitation centers,

223
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:15,900
specializing in treating
the aftereffects of the poison.

224
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,000
By the way,

225
00:12:17,590 --> 00:12:19,200
Uncle Zhong has been busy
doing business recently

226
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,460
and made a lot of money.

227
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,120
We took out half of it

228
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,180
and set up the Tianjiu Alley Fund.

229
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,370
All victims can receive subsidies

230
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,210
until they start a new life.

231
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:43,090
♪ As bells ring out, the old world falls ♪

232
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:43,920
I'm sorry,

233
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:45,180
Dad.

234
00:12:45,530 --> 00:12:48,760
♪ Tear through the dark
to safeguard the dawn ♪

235
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:49,000
I couldn't be the son you wanted me to be.

236
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:50,730
♪ Chasing the light ♪

237
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,080
But I will never forget

238
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:52,230
♪ And breaking through disorientation ♪

239
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:55,490
♪ Against the wind, we forge
a brand‑new chapter ♪

240
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:56,320
to protect what truly
needs to be protected.

241
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:58,900
♪ Who prays with palms pressed together? ♪

242
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,900
♪ Who grants me
the strength of redemption? ♪

243
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,720
Dad,

244
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,610
♪ Faith ♪

245
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:04,660
I don't need your blessing.

246
00:13:03,630 --> 00:13:05,460
♪ Is carved upon my chest ♪

247
00:13:05,760 --> 00:13:10,160
♪ Bursting forth in blazing dawn light ♪

248
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:11,270
I can walk my own path.

249
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,690
♪ No more wandering down the road ahead ♪

250
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:16,310
♪ My steps are unstoppable ♪

251
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,840
But if possible,

252
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:18,750
♪ Side by side, we go for tomorrow ♪

253
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:23,420
♪ Marching toward a new battlefield ♪

254
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,400
I beg you

255
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:30,240
♪ Behold the sinking sun
at the abyss's end ♪

256
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:26,580
to bless another person.

257
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:33,200
♪ A faint flicker of firelight ♪

258
00:13:33,230 --> 00:13:37,000
♪ Stubbornly illuminates
the endless night ♪

259
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:34,800
Please.

260
00:13:37,310 --> 00:13:40,100
♪ Like the last glimmer of hope ♪

261
00:13:40,740 --> 00:13:43,350
♪ An undying faith ♪

262
00:13:43,950 --> 00:13:46,890
♪ Against towering waves ♪

263
00:13:47,110 --> 00:13:52,050
♪ I chase the direction
of the dawn break ♪

264
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:54,870
[One year later]

265
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:18,250
Mr. Lu,

266
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,200
I'm very sorry to inform you

267
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:23,900
that Mr. Shen's cerebral condition
has deteriorated severely,

268
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:26,410
and his illness is beyond our control.

269
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:28,890
Please accept our deepest condolences.

270
00:14:29,770 --> 00:14:32,730
Mr. Shen specifically asked us
not to tell you,

271
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:35,890
but his remains have already
been transferred back to Ningcheng.

272
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:38,370
[Ningcheng Train Station]

273
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:28,020
Officer Shen,

274
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:30,510
